  "result": "{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#3442\", \"PowerToys#31472\", \"PowerToys#34532\"], \"answer\": \"This feature has been requested before, so it is a duplicate. Right-click file conversion for media, images and documents is tracked in #3442, the ffmpeg-style media converter that you cited yourself. Related requests are #31472 and #34532, which were closed as duplicates, and #2686, which asks for image format conversion in Image Resizer. The archive shows no implementation or committed plan. Maintainers have said the scope is hard to cover, because some formats need licences, conversion quality has to be near-perfect, and the team is small. Add a 👍 and any new detail, such as your batch, preset and HEIC/WebP/AVIF use cases, to #3442 or #2686. Until something ships, use an existing tool such as File Converter, which you linked, or ffmpeg or VLC for media.\"}",
